tancelin in his Alfa Romeo made the best start, followed by Wimille. Nuvolari's car hesitated on the line causing a chain reaction in which Sommer on the second row was partially blocked.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":1,"text":"Lehoux chases the two leaders, with Moll close behind from the third row.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":2,"text":"On lap two Nuvolari went into the lead, having passed four cars, but Etancelin stayed close behind attacking him constantly","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":5,"text":"Etancelin passes Nuvolari for the lead.","q":false,"c":8},{"lap":8,"text":"Varzi stops to replace oiled plugs.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":10,"text":"Zehender stops with overheating and takes on water.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":12,"text":"On lap 12 Nuvolari again took first place but on the following lap the Frenchman once again passed the Italian.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":16,"text":"Nuvolari retakes the lead.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":17,"text":"Nuvolari laps in 1m47s.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":23,"text":"On lap 23 Etancelin again took the lead.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":24,"text":"Nuvolari had to stop on lap 24 for a front brake adjustment, which dropped him back into third place, 34 seconds behind Lehoux and 59 seconds behind Etancelin.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":26,"text":"On lap 26 the Frenchman had an advantage of 20 seconds to Lehoux in second place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":30,"text":"On lap 30 Lehoux's Bugatti went into a skid and lost an awful lot of time so that Nuvolari moved into second place, only 30s behind Etancelin.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":4},{"lap":37,"text":"More and more the Italian was speeding up and on lap 37 the deficit had come down to only 17 seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":40,"text":"At the Place Mass\u00e9na hairpin bend Etancelin's Alfa Romeo went into a skid and his car spun round twice.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":40,"text":"Nuvolari takes the lead again.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":44,"text":"On lap 44 Lehoux changed the brakes on his Bugatti after he lost time with a slide in one of the turns.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":4},{"lap":48,"text":"After the first half of the race Nuvolari was 28 seconds ahead of Etancelin, who was followed by Dreyfus, Wimille, Moll, Lewis and Lehoux","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":56,"text":"the great sensation on lap 56 when Etancelin retired at the Gambetta corner after a brake rod broke on his Alfa.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":56,"text":"Disappointed and visibly tired the driver walked back to his pit while the spectators gave him well-earned applause.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":64,"text":"Varzi retired with a brake defect on lap 64.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":80,"text":"Wimille hangs on closely to Dreyfus in the fight for second place.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":90,"text":"A brake rod breaks on Wimille's Alfa; he retires.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":95,"text":"The crowd invaded the track and a group of about 20 enthusiastic Italian seamen carried the victor shoulder high along the Promenade des Anglais.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":95,"text":"Nuvolari wins; Dreyfus is second, Fagioli fourth after stops to adjust his shock absorbers.","q":false,"c":0}]}